<br class="ltx_break">Rank is computed using Borda count against all models, regardless of parameter count.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">MTEB(Eng, v2)</h4>

<div id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Compared to the models in <a href="#S4.T7" title="In MTEB(Multilingual, v2) ‣ 4.3 Results ‣ 4 Evaluation ‣ EmbeddingGemma: Powerful and Lightweight Text Representations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, EmbeddingGemma again achieves the highest overall scores and exceptional improvements in classification (+8.5), clustering (+7.8), and summarization (+4.4) compared to all other models. In fact, EmbeddingGemma also tops the sub-1B-parameter leaderboard in these task types (again excluding models with possible data leakage due to training with over 25% of the MTEB data).</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T8" class="ltx_table">
